PKSM_legal_server
=================

This project continues the work of FlagBrew/CoreAPI
(https://github.com/FlagBrew/CoreAPI), the API server that PKSM uses for auto
legality and GPSS. That project was abandoned (its last commit is 2023-10-11)
and it never published a license file; its history is kept intact in this
repository and can be read with:

    git log upstream/master

Upstream authors: FM1337, Allen (and dependabot for the dependency bumps).

The work added here is original work on top of that baseline: the routes the
PKSM app for 2ds/3ds needs, the legality engine on PKHeX/ALM 26.10.18, and the
automatic legalization driven by what the legality check reports.

